Audit boundaries:
- The patch registers ELF32 little-endian EM_SPARC and relocations 200-210.
- Static kernel links only. Dynamic SHAVE PLT emission is not implemented.
- Processor-specific relocation names are local recovered names, not an official
  ISA specification. Types 211-214 are accepted by getRelExpr but lack relocate
  handlers; do not use them. Standard SPARC paths are not SHAVE validation.
- Native assembler source inspected externally at the same pin uses only Python
  stdlib imports; it does not accept moviCompile assembly unchanged. Its default
  legalizer rewrites scheduling; --exact disables it. See wiki/NATIVE_TOOLCHAIN.md.
- Encoding tables are reconstructed from proprietary binaries per upstream notes.
  Their redistribution/legal status is not established by this engineering audit.

